This file is an adjusted copy of https://github.com/jk-jeon/dragonbox
Junekey Jeon agreed to license this file under MIT license explicitly for
usage in yaml-cpp.
We checked the corresponding GitHub repo it contains the following information in the README.md file https://github.com/jk-jeon/dragonbox/blob/master/README.md:
License
All code, except for those belong to third-party libraries (code in subproject/3rdparty), is licensed under either of

Apache License Version 2.0 with LLVM Exceptions (LICENSE-Apache2-LLVM or https://llvm.org/foundation/relicensing/LICENSE.txt) or
Boost Software License Version 1.0 (LICENSE-Boost or https://www.boost.org/LICENSE_1_0.txt). But since Junekey Jeon agreed to license the file under MIT in the context of yaml-cpp the dual licensing is irrelevant here. We concluded MIT as license of this file and we took the text of the MIT license from the LICENSE file in the root directory.
The information was retreived on 8th of Sept 2026 </text>
